{"ticker":"IQV","updated":"2026-10-30T22:54:06Z","profile":{"longName":"IQVIA Holdings Inc.","shortName":"IQVIA Holdings, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"United States","website":"https://www.iqvia.com","fullTimeEmployees":95000,"marketCap":44055982080,"trailingPE":32.521896,"forwardPE":18.782682,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.5449703,"pegRatio":1.0,"targetMeanPrice":309.7647,"targetHighPrice":346.0,"targetLowPrice":268.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.08,"earningsGrowth":0.088,"grossMargins":0.33066002,"operatingMargins":0.13731,"profitMargins":0.08053,"totalRevenue":17311000576,"beta":1.174,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":284.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":154.5,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"IQVIA Holdings Inc. provides clinical research services, commercial insights, and healthcare intelligence to the life sciences and healthcare industries in the Americas, Europe, Africa, and the Asia-Pacific. It operates through three segments: Technology & Analytics Solutions, Research & Development Solutions, and Contract Sales & Medical Solutions. The Technology & Analytics Solutions segment offers a range of cloud-based applications and associated implementation services; real world solutions that enable life sciences and provider customers to generate and disseminate evidence, which informs health care decision making and improves patients' outcomes; and strategic and implementation consulting services, such as advanced analytics and commercial processes outsourcing services. This segment also provides country level performance metrics related to sales of pharmaceutical products, prescribing trends, medical treatment, and promotional activity across various channels, including retail, hospital, and mail order; and measurement of sales or prescribing activity at the regional, zip code, and individual prescriber level. The Research & Development Solutions segment offers project management and clinical monitoring; clinical trial support; strategic planning and design services; and patient and site centric solutions, as well as central laboratory, genomic, bioanalytical, ADME, ","summary_zh":"IQVIA Holdings Inc. 為美洲、歐洲、非洲和亞太地區的生命科學和醫療保健產業提供臨床研究服務、商業見解和醫療保健情報。它透過三個部門運作：技術與分析解決方案、研究與開發解決方案以及合約銷售與醫療解決方案。技術與分析解決方案部門提供一系列基於雲端的應用程式和相關實施服務；現實世界的解決方案，使生命科學和提供者客戶能夠產生和傳播證據，為醫療保健決策提供資訊並改善患者的治療結果；策略和實施諮詢服務，例如高級分析和商業流程外包服務。該部門還提供與藥品銷售、處方趨勢、醫療和各種管道（包括零售、醫院和郵購）促銷活動相關的國家級績效指標；衡量地區、郵政編碼和個人處方者級別的銷售或處方活動。研究與開發解決方案部門提供專案管理和臨床監測；臨床試驗支援；策略規劃和設計服務；以患者和現場為中心的解決方案，以及中心實驗室、基因組、生物分析、ADME、","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"診斷與研究","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":189.28,"h":189.47,"l":183.47,"c":183.74,"v":1258900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":183.36,"h":185.35,"l":181.44,"c":184.62,"v":1194100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":183.46,"h":184.71,"l":177.82,"c":184.08,"v":1240400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":184.4,"h":188.68,"l":184.3,"c":187.68,"v":1263200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":185.65,"h":189.0,"l":183.7,"c":187.68,"v":1329300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":191.34,"h":191.86,"l":187.98,"c":189.64,"v":1201400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":189.26,"h":190.9,"l":183.1,"c":183.87,"v":1087900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":184.61,"h":190.69,"l":184.61,"c":190.69,"v":1378600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":188.38,"h":190.28,"l":186.47,"c":187.22,"v":946300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":187.4,"h":189.27,"l":185.48,"c":185.97,"v":1195100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":186.16,"h":188.29,"l":184.75,"c":186.81,"v":1005500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":186.95,"h":191.71,"l":185.49,"c":186.69,"v":955200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":188.01,"h":190.76,"l":186.97,"c":190.2,"v":988500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":190.0,"h":190.77,"l":187.17,"c":187.22,"v":2104100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":186.19,"h":189.29,"l":185.56,"c":187.83,"v":865200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":187.19,"h":189.62,"l":185.96,"c":186.45,"v":1072300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":186.28,"h":187.77,"l":180.55,"c":181.24,"v":954200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":179.53,"h":179.93,"l":176.16,"c":176.69,"